le Watch con NFC usando l’app Wallet.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/xiaomi-auto402x-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"xiaomi-auto402x\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null}],\"totalPages\":79}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":["tj-posts"]}